# SS-08 - Shared-cash portfolio and basket experiments
Workstream ID: SS-08
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/8
Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M3
Dependencies: SS-07, SS-10

## Purpose
Build smallcase-style research baskets without implying integration with that service.

## Tasks
- [ ] Create versioned baskets, weights, cash rules, sizing and rebalance schedules.
- [ ] Align instruments/calendars without fabricated or forward-filled tradable candles.
- [ ] Allocate simultaneous orders against one cash ledger with costs/actions.
- [ ] Report contribution, turnover, exposure, drawdown and benchmark comparisons.
- [ ] Test overlapping signals, unavailable assets, delistings and insufficient cash.

## Acceptance criteria
- No double-spending; weights and units reconcile to shared equity.
- A basket result is not the naive mean of separately fully-funded stock backtests.

## Completion evidence
- Not started; native roadmap tab explicitly labels baskets as planned.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Registered portfolio implementation separately from single-stock M1.
